       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INDEX-CHAIN.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 T.
       05 P PIC X(8) OCCURS 1000000.
       01 FIRST-IDX PIC 9(7).
       01 MID-IDX PIC 9(7).
       01 IDX PIC 9(7).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MOVE 'OLD' TO P(1).
       MOVE 1 TO FIRST-IDX.
       MOVE FIRST-IDX TO MID-IDX.
       MOVE MID-IDX TO IDX.
       MOVE 'GOOD' TO P(IDX).
       CALL P(1).
       GOBACK.
